 "nodes": {
  "8477894": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Josef",
   "expression": 3,
   "expressionName": "Sad",
   "text": "They said the company's direction is changing, and they need new leadership to take it forward.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1329364376": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expression": 3,
   "expressionName": "Sad",
   "text": "Oh, Josef. I’m so sorry. I know how much you loved that job. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "526095460": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Josef",
   "expression": 3,
   "expressionName": "Sad",
   "text": "The debts are much worse than you think...",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1657610004": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Josef",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "The mortgage on the aparment, and the investments that didn’t pan out... It's all adding up.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1851401800": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "But we’ll get through this together. It’s just a setback.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1268354407": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "What do you mean? We’ve been managing, haven’t we?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-806102909": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "That sounds managable, I can start working again too.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-284939083": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Josef",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "And we still haven't paid off the car that Adrian broke.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1338093782": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "That's not too bad, It was only around fifty thousand dollar, right?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1917678714": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Josef",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "And there's debt from your surgery years ago...",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "675157213": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I thought health insurance covered that!?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "462482379": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Josef",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I lied to you so you would feel less guilty about it...",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1361325540": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "God, Josef. How bad it is?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1045423309": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Josef",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "We need about a million dollars to cover everything...",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-644251220": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Josef",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "We’ll have to make some hard decisions. We might have to move out...",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-17741352": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Josef",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I’ll start looking for another job immediately, but with the current job market, it might take some time.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1160150896": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Move out? N-No... Josef, you know I love this place...",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-154139425": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Josef",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "We've got three months of rent covered... Maybe we can find a way to turn the ship around until then...",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  }
 },
